	(text "Stereo headphone amp, 9 V battery, single supply, NJM4556A (70 mA out)\nU1A = right (ring), U1B = left (tip)\nVref = 9 V x R8 / (R7 + R8) = 4.5 V, C3 47 uF makes it an AC ground\nG = 1 + R3 / R4 = 1 + 22k / 10k = 3.2 (+10 dB); C6 gives DC gain 1\nf_in = 1 / (2 pi 100k 1 uF) = 1.6 Hz;  f_fb = 1 / (2 pi 10k 22 uF) = 0.7 Hz\nf_out = 1 / (2 pi RL 1000 uF) = 10 Hz at 16 ohm, 5 Hz at 32 ohm\nI_out max 70 mA: 2.2 V pk = 78 mW into 32 ohm, 1.1 V pk = 39 mW into 16 ohm\nR9/R10 hold the jack side at 0 V so plugging in does not pop"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
